      "id": "b001",
      "kind": "narration",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "hanzi": "小明今年十岁，住在一栋大楼里。他是个善良的孩子。一天下午，他在楼下玩。这时，他看见一个新邻居在搬一盆大的植物。那盆植物很重，是一棵发财树，叶子很绿。新邻居搬得很辛苦。",
      "traditional": null,
      "pinyin": "Xiǎo Míng jīnnián shí suì, zhù zài yī dòng dàlóu lǐ. Tā shì gè shànliáng de háizi. Yītiān xiàwǔ, tā zài lóu xià wán. Zhèshí, tā kànjiàn yī gè xīn línjū zài bān yī pén dà de zhíwù. Nà pén zhíwù hěn zhòng, shì yī kē fācái shù, yèzi hěn lǜ. Xīn línjū bān de hěn xīnkǔ.",
      "translation": "Xiao Ming is ten years old and lives in a big apartment building. He is a kind child. One afternoon, he was playing downstairs. At that moment, he saw a new neighbor carrying a large plant. The plant was very heavy—it was a money tree with very green leaves. The new neighbor was struggling with it.",
