      "hanzi": "小明和李华一起慢慢地搬那盆植物上楼梯。他们搬得很小心，因为植物很大。到了五楼，李华打开门，说：“请进来坐一会儿吧。”",
      "traditional": null,
      "pinyin": "Xiǎo Míng hé Lǐ Huá yīqǐ mànmàn de bān nà pén zhíwù shàng lóutī. Tāmen bān de hěn xiǎoxīn, yīnwèi zhíwù hěn dà. Dào le wǔ lóu, Lǐ Huá dǎkāi mén, shuō: “Qǐng jìnlái zuò yīhuìr ba.”",
      "translation": "Xiao Ming and Li Hua slowly carried the plant up the stairs together. They were very careful because the plant was big. When they reached the fifth floor, Li Hua opened the door and said, “Please come in and sit for a while.”",
