    {
      "id": "b007",
      "kind": "narration",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "hanzi": "小明走进李华的家。她的家很漂亮，客厅里有一个大窗户。小明看到窗外有绿树，他觉得很开心。李华给他一杯水，说：“谢谢你帮我。我们是邻居了，以后可以常来玩。”",
      "traditional": null,
      "pinyin": "Xiǎo Míng zǒu jìn Lǐ Huá de jiā. Tā de jiā hěn piàoliang, kètīng lǐ yǒu yī gè dà chuānghu. Xiǎo Míng kàndào chuāng wài yǒu lǜ shù, tā juéde hěn kāixīn. Lǐ Huá gěi tā yī bēi shuǐ, shuō: “Xièxiè nǐ bāng wǒ. Wǒmen shì línjū le, yǐhòu kěyǐ cháng lái wán.”",
      "translation": "Xiao Ming walked into Li Hua's home. Her home was very beautiful, with a big window in the living room. Xiao Ming saw green trees outside the window and felt very happy. Li Hua gave him a glass of water and said, “Thank you for helping me. We are neighbors now; you can come and play often in the future.”",
